 "notes": "Entity y = feet cell. Ground (footpath) top is row 10 in this level. Verandah slabs (row 4) float over the footpath on posts (T), gables/parapets/upstairs stack on top (rows 1-3): a continuous rooftop route with <=2 steps and <=4 gaps, reached by verandah posts, drainpipes, trees, the church fence, or double jump + ledge grab. Enemies with route:\"roof\" patrol the rooftops. Main path stays on the footpath (walk + single jump). Cars are slow bump-only shuttles."
